---
import { getImage } from 'astro:assets';
import problemImage from '../../../src/assets/img/pexels-karola-g-5908818.webp';

const zinInputs = await getImage({ src: problemImage, format: 'webp', quality: 85 });
---
  <section class="sec sec-light">

    <div class="container">

      <div class="row">

        <div class="col-sm-12 col-md-8 pe-5">

          <span class="zin-eyebrow">The lost thought problem.</span>

          <h2 class="zin-h2 mb-4">That great idea lasts about 10-20 seconds</h2>

          <p class="zin-body mb-3">
            <b>Thoughts fade fast</b>
            <br />
            If you keep walking when a thought or great idea comes, and you don’t repeat the thought to yourself, it may vanish before you reach for your phone. That idea is lost.
          </p>

          <p class="zin-body mb-3">
            <b>The itch of unresolved thinking</b>
            <br />
             Longer-term thoughts are an open loop that keep the brain constantly re-checking. It drains energy and keeps you distracted.
          </p>
          
          <p class="zin-body mb-3">
            <b>Your written thoughts are hidden</b>
            <br />
            They are buried in years of posts, emails, documents, notebooks and half-finished drafts. 
          </p>

        </div>

        <div class="col-sm-12 col-md-4">

          <img
          src={problemImage.src}
          alt="Zin — lack of capture is the problem"
          class="solution-img"
          loading="lazy"
          decoding="async"
        />
          
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>